                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "River City Melee Mach is an homage to the old school kunio kun games. It is kind of a fighter game with more of beat em up style. The teams are very likable mixture of old and new characters. The fighting is enjoyable because a lot of the fighters have different movesets. The disappointing part for me was how little range the maps had and how short the story was. As i said the story is very short and it unfortunately feels like a filler. The Nekketsu Kunio Kun series are so many peoples childhood favourites and i feel like this game is not scratching that itch. If you see it on sale you can buy it but don't expect much out of it.",
